<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AAA to Rentenbank's samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AAA to Rentenbank's samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Friday that it had assigned an AAA rating to Landwirtschaftliche Rentenbank's 30 billion yen worth of 4.9 percent yen/dollar dual-currency bonds due March 13, 2000.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating is stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
